.6,143.3\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><line x1=\"46\" y1=\"146\" x2=\"46\" y2=\"24\"/><polygon points=\"46,24 48.7,30.4 43.3,30.4\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><text x=\"318\" y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">t</text><text x=\"50\" y=\"20\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">y</text><polyline points=\"46,132.9 49,127.8 52,122.9 55.1,118.4 58.1,114 61.1,109.9 64.1,106.1 67.2,102.4 70.2,99 73.2,95.7 76.2,92.6 79.2,89.7 82.3,86.9 85.3,84.3 88.3,81.8 91.3,79.4 94.4,77.2 97.4,75.1 100.4,73.1 103.4,71.3 106.4,69.5 109.5,67.8 112.5,66.2 115.5,64.7 118.5,63.3 121.6,61.9 124.6,60.7 127.6,59.5 130.6,58.3 133.6,57.2 136.7,56.2 139.7,55.3 142.7,54.3 145.7,53.5 148.8,52.7 151.8,51.9 154.8,51.2 157.8,50.5 160.8,49.8 163.9,49.2 166.9,48.6 169.9,48.1 172.9,47.5 176,47 179,46.6 182,46.1 185,45.7 188,45.3 191.1,44.9 194.1,44.6 197.1,44.3 200.1,43.9 203.2,43.6 206.2,43.4 209.2,43.1 212.2,42.8 215.2,42.6 218.3,42.4 221.3,42.1 224.3,41.9 227.3,41.7 230.4,41.6 233.4,41.4 236.4,41.2 239.4,41.1 242.4,40.9 245.5,40.8 248.5,40.7 251.5,40.5 254.5,40.4 257.6,40.3 260.6,40.2 263.6,40.1 266.6,40 269.6,39.9 272.7,39.8 275.7,39.8 278.7,39.7 281.7,39.6 284.8,39.6 287.8,39.5 290.8,39.4 293.8,39.4 296.8,39.3 299.9,39.3 302.9,39.2 305.9,39.2 308.9,39.1 312,39.1 315,39.1 318,39\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/></svg>","figure_alt":"A smooth curve that rises toward a horizontal line."},{"id":"first-order-sys-r4-q2","version":2,"round":4,"type":"numeric","prompt":"Step-response specs quote a time constant. For \\(1.7\\dot{y} + y = 2u\\), that time constant is","answer":1.7,"unit":"s","tolerance":0.02,"explanation":"With the coefficient of \\(y\\) equal to 1, \\(\\tau\\) is the coefficient of \\(\\dot{y}\\), so \\(\\tau = 1.7\\) s. The 2 is the DC gain. Their product 3.4 and their ratio \\(2/1.7\\) mix the gain into the timing.","preview":["sys-id"],"figure":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 176\" role=\"i